THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This project builds against NVIDIA CUTLASS, which is not vendored here: it is
referenced as a git submodule (third_party/cutlass, pinned to 8debf774) and
modified before the build by patches/cutlass_biloco.patch. CUTLASS is distributed
by NVIDIA Corporation under the BSD-3-Clause license; see
third_party/cutlass/LICENSE.txt after initializing the submodule. The patch adds
one header (binarysvd_side_hook.hpp) and calls to it in the SM100 warp-specialized
GEMM kernels, tile schedulers and epilogue, used to launch and run the side CTAs.
